aph","text":"バイキングさん♪\n本当に沢山お世話になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげでとっても楽しくなりました(*ˊૢᵕˋૢ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてアルバムの個別握手会では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１３日の金曜日の衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0026.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１０枚目シングルの個別はこの服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにネコミミ(≡'・'≡)ﾆｬﾝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからみんなの声も沢山聞こえたよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中会いに来てくれて ありがとう\n(∩´∀`∩)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての方やお久しぶり～の方、いつもの方と楽しい話が出来て楽しすぎたよ～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同年代やご夫婦さんもきてくれたり、\nまあ家族さん達が仲良しになったり、\nお友達を誘ってきてくれたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントも楽しみに読んでます(^^)\n初コメさんもお久しぶりコメさんも いつもコメさんも ありがとう^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、サイリウムはね  黄色だよ～(^O^)\nもし、２本持ってくれるなら、イエローとオレンジ（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんの誕生日もお祝いしてくれてありがとう～無事に退院したよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと今回もブログ更新遅れてごめんなしゃいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強も頑張りたいからブログが遅れちゃうこともあるけど‥\n頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろう！って言ってもらえると凄く心強いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人数がいる乃木坂46のメンバーの中で\nまあやに来てくれてたりコメントしてくれたり...本当に嬉しいなっ(*ˊૢᵕˋૢ*) ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月はイベント多くて嬉しいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6日は みなみ♪\n誕生日おめでとう*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋では、みなみとひなちまの3人が一緒に居ることが多くて一緒にいるのが普通すぎて\n最近写真撮ってないね～笑\n初期からずっと仲良し♪こんなに一緒にいるのに喧嘩とかしたことないねっ(*ˊૢᵕˋૢ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそう思えばメンバーとまだまあや喧嘩とかしたことないやっ！(｡>ㅿ<｡)いいのか悪いのか(⋈◍＞◡＜◍)。✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に遊んだりお泊りしたりしようねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大スキだよ みなみ～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0034.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんⒽ⃞ⓐ⃞ⓟ⃞ⓟ⃞ⓨ⃞ ᵕ̈*Ⓑ⃞ⓘ⃞ⓡ⃞ⓣ⃞ⓗ⃞ⓓ⃞ⓐ⃞ⓨ⃞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期からずっとまあやのこと気にかけてくれて夜遅くてもまあやの家に相談乗りにわざわざ来てくれたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に心から感謝してるよんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強もできて、性格も良くて、可愛くて欠点見つからないよ～(´･ε･｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにここだけの話初めていうけど、\nかずみん家行ってまったりしてたら\nかずみん寝ちゃって...その間に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お野菜栽培するミニサイズのを買ってきてたの思い出して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとだけ準備しようと思ってちょっとだけ準備したとき土をちょっとこぼしちゃったんだっ(๑>ᴗ<๑)ﾃﾍｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなしゃいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0038.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまたチームＤのちーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0039.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームＤにまあやがプラスするとチューリップっていう、チーム名になるんだよっ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんは話す時に ずぅぅっとまあやのくちびる見てくるのっ(*ﾉωﾉ)ﾎﾟｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのくちびるいつも\nプルンプルンッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0040.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言って褒めてくれるのっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このくちびるのプルプルはまいちゅんのリップクリームのおかげですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0041.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今も まいちゅんは無言でまあやにリップクリームを差し出してくれましたっ(∩´∀`∩)♡笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこのさい言わせて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0042.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんまあやのくちびる見すぎ～～～**(/▽/)**ハズカチッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0043.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/02/11/6272086/0044.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業発表したせいたん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表前から今後の事話し合った時にせいたんが卒業の話をしてくれて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり寂しいけど夢とか持っててなんかすごいな